  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;"
  },
